text-cmds (199+ds1-2) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * The source URL names the GitHub repository.
  * Build-Depend on pietoolchain-host and pietoolchain-sdk.
  * sort makes its temporary files with mkstemp. It no longer follows a link
    that another user plants under the next file's name.
  * sort -o with an output that is also an input writes a temporary file made
    with mkstemp. It no longer follows a link planted under OUTPUT.tmp. With
    --compress-program the output is no longer compressed, and with -c or -C
    the file is left alone.
  * Update jq to 1.8.2, which fixes memory errors and crashes on crafted
    input and programs.
  * jq's regular expression parser sets a backreference's level before it
    reads it.

